  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {主演|しゅえん}する (to star in)\n- {主演|しゅえん}を{務|つと}める (to take on the starring role)\n- 〜{主演|しゅえん} (starring ~)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {主演|しゅえん}{俳優|はいゆう}/{女優|じょゆう} (lead actor/actress)\n- {主演|しゅえん}{映画|えいが} (movie in which one stars)\n- W{主演|しゅえん} (double leads, co-starring)\n- {初|はつ}{主演|しゅえん} (first starring role)\n\nOTHER ROLES:\n- {助演|じょえん} (supporting role)\n- {共演|きょうえん} (co-starring)\n- {出演|しゅつえん} (appearing in, performing)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {主役|しゅやく} (protagonist, main character)\n- {出演|しゅつえん} (appearing, performing)\n- {共演|きょうえん} (co-starring)",
